    },
    {
      "displayText": "它是在哭吧？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B83662F572854ED5427FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "刚才小电音……电音婴\n拿到了我给它的密阿雷格雷派饼后，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n一眨眼的功夫就给弄丢了……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǇ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "521A624D5C0F753597F320262026753597F35A74000A62FF52304E8662117ED95B8376845BC6963F96F7683C96F76D3E997C540EFF0C00100001BE00000A4E007728773C7684529F592B5C317ED95F044E224E862026202600100002011401C70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过，小电音平时是\n喜欢仔细品尝食物的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǇ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8FC7FF0C5C0F753597F35E7365F6662F000A559C6B224ED47EC654C15C1D98DF72697684300200100002011401C70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这位训练家，请你把小电音弄丢的\n密阿雷格雷派饼找回来吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǇ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD94F4D8BAD7EC35BB6FF0C8BF74F60628A5C0F753597F35F044E227684000A5BC6963F96F7683C96F76D3E997C627E56DE67655427FF0100100002011401C70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "音～嗯。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "97F3FF5E55EF30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你做好准备去寻找\n小电音弄丢的密阿雷格雷派饼了吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǇ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60505A597D51C6590753BB5BFB627E000A5C0F753597F35F044E2276845BC6963F96F7683C96F76D3E997C4E865417FF1F00100002011401C70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可以去找了！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF4EE553BB627E4E86FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果你能帮可怜的小电音\n去找的话，我会感激你的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǇ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C4F6080FD5E2E53EF601C76845C0F753597F3000A53BB627E76848BDDFF0C62114F1A611F6FC04F607684300200100002011401C70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "谢谢你！\n不过话说回来，该去哪里找呢？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǇ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8C228C224F60FF01000A4E0D8FC78BDD8BF456DE6765FF0C8BE553BB54EA91CC627E5462FF1F00100002011401C70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "狐嘶嘶。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "72D05636563630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "音嗯！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "97F355EFFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "小电音！你的密阿雷格雷派饼\n就是被那只宝可梦偷走的对吧！？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǇ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0F753597F3FF014F6076845BC6963F96F7683C96F76D3E997C000A5C31662F88AB90A353EA5B9D53EF68A650778D7076845BF95427FF01FF1F00100002011401C70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这位训练家！就是那只宝可梦……\n请你追上那只狡小狐！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n不，是捉住它！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǇ",
