      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 1612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "97F3FF5E55EF266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "野生宝可梦为了活下去会偷吃人类的食物，\n这一点我也能理解，不过……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n密阿雷毕竟是个人类与宝可梦共生的城市嘛。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǇ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 1624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "91CE751F5B9D53EF68A64E3A4E866D3B4E0B53BB4F1A507754034EBA7C7B768498DF7269FF0C000A8FD94E0070B962114E5F80FD740689E3FF0C4E0D8FC72026202600100001BE00000A5BC6963F96F76BD57ADF662F4E2A4EBA7C7B4E0E5B9D53EF68A65171751F768457CE5E02561B300200100002011401C70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这位训练家，多亏了你，\n小电音看来会交到一个朋友了！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n多谢你了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǇ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 1748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD94F4D8BAD7EC35BB6FF0C591A4E8F4E864F60FF0C000A5C0F753597F3770B67654F1A4EA452304E004E2A670B53CB4E86FF0100100001BE00000A591A8C224F604E86300200100002011401C70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
